{"4283160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void's Rage", "steam_appid": 4283160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void’s Rage</strong> blends the competitive rush of <strong>arcade</strong> games with the fast-paced combat of <strong>hack and slash</strong> titles. Featuring fluid movement, stylish acrobatics and a vibrant visual style, the game challenges you to score as many points as possible in the shortest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short: <strong>SLICE THROUGH CREATURES  WITH INSANE ACROBATICS</strong>, blast through arenas to a heavy soundtrack, and rack up massive scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the creatures of the Void using razor-sharp reflexes and insane combat skills…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh... and don't forget to enjoy the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> is the key to higher scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate it at the right moment to earn double score and regain health but be careful. A bad timing can waste the ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score multiplier will guarantee great rewards. It's through this that the frenzy mode will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your multiplier reaches zero, you will take damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to stay alert and regain your aggressiveness... if you want to survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void’s Rage</strong> blends the competitive rush of <strong>arcade</strong> games with the fast-paced combat of <strong>hack and slash</strong> titles. Featuring fluid movement, stylish acrobatics and a vibrant visual style, the game challenges you to score as many points as possible in the shortest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short: <strong>SLICE THROUGH CREATURES  WITH INSANE ACROBATICS</strong>, blast through arenas to a heavy soundtrack, and rack up massive scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/613fe3ba7c77953ad77a308ea84a5397.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the creatures of the Void using razor-sharp reflexes and insane combat skills…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh... and don't forget to enjoy the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/2a5ca05123f11377d86a99fd64062292.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> is the key to higher scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate it at the right moment to earn double score and regain health but be careful. A bad timing can waste the ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.poster.avif?t=1780610134\" width=940 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.webm?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/extras/49023004948bdc2927abc98d80c86b28.mp4?t=1780610134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score multiplier will guarantee great rewards. It's through this that the frenzy mode will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your multiplier reaches zero, you will take damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to stay alert and regain your aggressiveness... if you want to survive.</p>", "short_description": "Void’s Rage is a fast-paced, ultra-responsive hack n' slash game inspired by arcade games. With each match, improve your combat reflexes, achieve the highest scores on the leaderboard, and defeat the evil creatures of the void once and for all.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/8a620a65256a06d2bdb47b6a67ab2c77feac178b/header.jpg?t=1780610134", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4283160/458becc92a71698bdbf0b57ddc3a3c9668ee3023/capsule_231x87.jpg?t